        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "You could call A-Yuan \"Pang Ge\" (Chubby Guy), too. The \"Yuan\" in his name sounds like \"yuan\" (round), and his round belly makes him chubby.",
